cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ClaimSignal's software or research artifacts, please cite this project."
title: "ClaimSignal: A reproducible research lab for Jev decision primitives"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Muchhala
    given-names: Sanket
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-25
url: "https://github.com/sanketmuchhala/ClaimSignal"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sanketmuchhala/ClaimSignal"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - AI evaluation
  - Jev
  - model comparison
  - calibration
  - selective prediction
  - insurance claims
abstract: >-
  ClaimSignal evaluates Jev's typed choice, score, and noul decisions on historical
  insurance claims. It includes declared experiments, captured model outputs,
  statistical baselines, grouped uncertainty analysis, and offline report
  reproduction. The results are limited to the documented claims data and do not
  establish suitability for production or public-sector decisions.
